			"width": 854,
			"height": 22.5,
			"text": "D.Q. 麦克伦尼《Being Logical: A Guide to Good Thinking》｜5 章 · 74 节 · 28 种谬误",
			"originalText": "D.Q. 麦克伦尼《Being Logical: A Guide to Good Thinking》｜5 章 · 74 节 · 28 种谬误",
