		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "YDKhmJJm",
			"x": 1482,
			"y": 1016,
			"width": 274,
			"height": 52.5,
			"text": "✓ 肯定前件（有效）\n如果 P 则 Q；P；∴ Q\n例：如果下雨，地会湿；下雨了；∴ 地会湿",
			"originalText": "✓ 肯定前件（有效）\n如果 P 则 Q；P；∴ Q\n例：如果下雨，地会湿；下雨了；∴ 地会湿",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"strokeColor": "#22c55e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"angle": 0,
